    "County, municipal and legislative races not yet loaded",
    "sos.ga.gov and the My Voter Page returned a Cloudflare 403 on 2026-10-31, so statewide contests come from three county composite sample ballots (Columbia, Fulton, Houston), which list identical statewide candidates; the write-in list and amendment text are Secretary of State documents republished by Columbia County.",
