    "Certified write-in candidates are listed for Governor only (the SoS final write-in list names none for other statewide offices).",
    "No statewide Supreme Court or Court of Appeals contests appear on the November ballot (Georgia elects appellate judges in the May nonpartisan election).",
    "Candidate campaign websites not yet checked.",
    "Three statewide constitutional amendments (HR 32, HR 251, HR 1243) are on the ballot, with ballot language from the General Assembly's as-passed resolutions on legis.ga.gov. There are no statewide referendum questions: the Secretary of State's booklet lists only Amendments 1-3. Local referendums (TSPLOST, ESPLOST, homestead) are not loaded."
